      "title": "Enterprise_Security_Compliance_Policy",
      "originalName": "Enterprise_Security_Compliance_Policy.txt",
      "mimeType": "text/plain",
      "fileSizeBytes": 12000,
      "storagePath": "/uploads/Enterprise_Security_Compliance_Policy.txt",
      "status": "COMPLETED",
      "rawText": "ENTERPRISE SECURITY & INFORMATION GOVERNANCE POLICY\nDocument Code: SEC-POL-2026-v2\nClassification: Internal Enterprise Only\n\n1. Purpose & Scope\nThis policy mandates stringent access control, role-based encryption, and confidential data storage protocols for all enterprise documents handled by Doc.DOOM systems.\n\n2. Access Control Principles\n- Principle of Least Privilege: Every user account is isolated via PostgreSQL Row Level Security (RLS).\n- Document data belonging to User A must never be accessible, queryable, or retrievable by User B.\n- Dual-key authorization is mandatory for cross-repository audit workflows.\n\n3. Retention and Sanitization\n- All deleted documents must have their physical storage files unlinked and purged immediately.\n- Database records including entities, analysis, and vector indices must be permanently removed upon deletion.\n- Audit logs are retained for compliance verification.",
      "pageCount": 2,
      "createdAt": "2026-10-22T14:37:35.393Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-22T14:37:35.393Z",
      "analysis": {
        "id": "analysis-doc-seed-4",
        "documentId": "doc-seed-4",
        "category": "Enterprise Policy",
        "shortSummary": "Internal enterprise security policy mandating strict user data isolation, RLS enforcement, and permanent document deletion rules.",
        "detailedSummary": "Outlines governance principles for institutional data handling. Enforces tenant isolation where documents belonging to one user can never be queried by another. Details physical storage unlinking and atomic database record purging.",
        "mainPurpose": "Establish mandatory security, privacy, and data isolation protocols across all enterprise applications.",
        "keyTopics": [
          "User Data Isolation",
          "Row Level Security",
          "Document Purging Standards",
          "Least Privilege"
        ],
        "confidenceScore": 0.99,
        "language": "en",
        "wordCount": 165,
        "processingDurationMs": 480,
